# Premium Todo App Finalization Plan

This plan aims to resolve the styling issues caused by the Tailwind v4 migration and finalize the unit testing suite.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> The project uses **Tailwind v4** and **Next.js 16**, which have breaking changes compared to previous versions. The styling was previously not loading because of v3 syntax in the CSS files. I will migrate the CSS to the modern v4 `@import` syntax and `@theme` block.

> [!WARNING]
> The unit testing environment (Vitest + Happy DOM) is experiencing intermittent "Unhandled Errors" likely due to how **Framer Motion** and **Node 24** interact with workers. I will implement a robust mock for Framer Motion in the test setup to ensure tests pass reliably while focusing on functional verification in the browser.

